(3955532, 564248, 60862, '<td valign="top">Fun!  Maybe this''ll be your second. :)  For jumping shots, it''s usually more effective to show the ground, to emphasize how high you are.  Same thing goes for cropping - show more below you than above.</td>', 'Fun!  Maybe this''ll be your second. :)  For jumping shots, it''s usually more effective to show the ground, to emphasize how high you are.  Same thing goes for cropping - show more below you than above.', '2007-08-01 02:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
