(3958256, 563315, 81674, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great photo! excellent work on composition and exposure! My only suggestion is the depth of field seems a bit too extreme. I agree that the plane shouldn''t be in focus, but I think this should could be improved if the plane were a bit more in focus, it almost hurts my eyes it is so blurry. Just a suggestion</td>', 'I think this is a great photo! excellent work on composition and exposure! My only suggestion is the depth of field seems a bit too extreme. I agree that the plane shouldn''t be in focus, but I think this should could be improved if the plane were a bit more in focus, it almost hurts my eyes it is so blurry. Just a suggestion', '2007-08-01 16:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958265, 563499, 81674, '<td valign="top">interesting shot! I think the hurdler needs to be lightened up a bit, and it would help your composition if you raised the trees to 1/3 of the way up the picture. They are too low, it leaves me looking for what he is really jumping over</td>', 'interesting shot! I think the hurdler needs to be lightened up a bit, and it would help your composition if you raised the trees to 1/3 of the way up the picture. They are too low, it leaves me looking for what he is really jumping over', '2007-08-01 16:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
