(3958273, 562418, 81674, '<td valign="top">this looks too gray, it seems to have an exposure problem. The tree on the side needs to be cropped or have more of it showing.</td>', 'this looks too gray, it seems to have an exposure problem. The tree on the side needs to be cropped or have more of it showing.', '2007-08-01 16:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
