(3959765, 563640, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great high contrast!!!  I get tired of these shots and then this comes along.  Pure exuberance.  Great shot. 8</td>', 'Great high contrast!!!  I get tired of these shots and then this comes along.  Pure exuberance.  Great shot. 8', '2007-08-02 00:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959770, 564265, 62807, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. Love his expression. Nice job!</td>', 'Beautiful colors. Love his expression. Nice job!', '2007-08-02 00:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959775, 562519, 62807, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Wonderful shot!', '2007-08-02 00:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959780, 564543, 15711, '<td valign="top">HA HA HA HA -  still have mine from my 12 year old. Cool</td>', 'HA HA HA HA -  still have mine from my 12 year old. Cool', '2007-08-02 00:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959788, 563640, 62807, '<td valign="top">Truly captures the challenge. Great shot! 10</td>', 'Truly captures the challenge. Great shot! 10', '2007-08-02 00:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959789, 564440, 62807, '<td valign="top">Love the color and texture. Beautiful photo!</td>', 'Love the color and texture. Beautiful photo!', '2007-08-02 00:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959794, 564246, 62807, '<td valign="top">10! Everything PERFECT! Great job.</td>', '10! Everything PERFECT! Great job.', '2007-08-02 00:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959795, 564323, 62807, '<td valign="top">10!!!! Love this shot! My ribbon choice. Good luck and well done!!!</td>', '10!!!! Love this shot! My ribbon choice. Good luck and well done!!!', '2007-08-02 00:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959798, 563721, 62807, '<td valign="top">Great focus, cute little boy. How exciting! Great job!</td>', 'Great focus, cute little boy. How exciting! Great job!', '2007-08-02 00:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959806, 563129, 41409, '<td valign="top">This is a fun capture.  What a great moment and a great expression.</td>', 'This is a fun capture.  What a great moment and a great expression.', '2007-08-02 00:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959810, 563875, 41409, '<td valign="top">This one is going to do great in the challenge.  Perfect focus and panning.</td>', 'This one is going to do great in the challenge.  Perfect focus and panning.', '2007-08-02 00:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959817, 564449, 41409, '<td valign="top">I like this one, but it doesn''t really convey triumph whether in the photo or the title.  Also, maybe some reduced DOF would be nice.</td>', 'I like this one, but it doesn''t really convey triumph whether in the photo or the title.  Also, maybe some reduced DOF would be nice.', '2007-08-02 00:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959819, 562519, 41409, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Amazing shot!  What great detail.</td>', 'WOW!  Amazing shot!  What great detail.', '2007-08-02 00:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959820, 561453, 41409, '<td valign="top">This one is good, however I''d add a touch of sharpness, some contrast, and some extra saturation to really make it pop.</td>', 'This one is good, however I''d add a touch of sharpness, some contrast, and some extra saturation to really make it pop.', '2007-08-02 00:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959833, 564605, 41409, '<td valign="top">This one is pretty noisy and doesn''t really convey any triumph.  I do, however, love the silhouette look and the sharpness you''ve captured here.  The person in the frame really gives a sense of how big that crane really is.</td>', 'This one is pretty noisy and doesn''t really convey any triumph.  I do, however, love the silhouette look and the sharpness you''ve captured here.  The person in the frame really gives a sense of how big that crane really is.', '2007-08-02 00:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959834, 562253, 41409, '<td valign="top">Exceptional action capture.  You got pretty much perfect timing here.</td>', 'Exceptional action capture.  You got pretty much perfect timing here.', '2007-08-02 00:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959835, 563869, 15407, '<td valign="top">What is this about with the ''device'' on the eagle? My actions would involve getting it off of the poor bird and releasing it into nature! Upon another look at this photo that may well have been his demise!  Glad I took another look at this it!</td>', 'What is this about with the ''device'' on the eagle? My actions would involve getting it off of the poor bird and releasing it into nature! Upon another look at this photo that may well have been his demise!  Glad I took another look at this it!', '2007-08-02 00:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959845, 563957, 41409, '<td valign="top">Haha, great idea.  Things to improve on...maybe try and focus more on the hands and less on the background.  Not sure if this is an effect of noise reduction or not though, it could be.  Also, maybe try and use channel mixer to conver to b/w and make it a bit brighter, this one seems kind of dull.</td>', 'Haha, great idea.  Things to improve on...maybe try and focus more on the hands and less on the background.  Not sure if this is an effect of noise reduction or not though, it could be.  Also, maybe try and use channel mixer to conver to b/w and make it a bit brighter, this one seems kind of dull.', '2007-08-02 00:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959851, 563767, 41409, '<td valign="top">This would be excellent if it wasn''t for the netting in the foreground.  One way to avoid this more is to use the longest lens you can find, widest aperture, and put it right up against the net.  That should throw the net far enough out of focus to not even be visible.</td>', 'This would be excellent if it wasn''t for the netting in the foreground.  One way to avoid this more is to use the longest lens you can find, widest aperture, and put it right up against the net.  That should throw the net far enough out of focus to not even be visible.', '2007-08-02 00:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959855, 564314, 41409, '<td valign="top">Amazing portrait, I love it.  This will do well in this challenge.</td>', 'Amazing portrait, I love it.  This will do well in this challenge.', '2007-08-02 00:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959857, 563486, 41409, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love the emotion in this one.  This is truely triumph.</td>', 'Great shot, I love the emotion in this one.  This is truely triumph.', '2007-08-02 00:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959859, 564506, 41409, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really meet the challenge...</td>', 'Doesn''t really meet the challenge...', '2007-08-02 00:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959861, 564369, 41409, '<td valign="top">This would be great if it was brighter and also not as greenish looking.</td>', 'This would be great if it was brighter and also not as greenish looking.', '2007-08-02 00:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959866, 563315, 41409, '<td valign="top">Great portrait.  This really shows triumph at it''s best.  The only thing I can offer would be to not blur out the plane as much as it seems to be a key part of your composition.</td>', 'Great portrait.  This really shows triumph at it''s best.  The only thing I can offer would be to not blur out the plane as much as it seems to be a key part of your composition.', '2007-08-02 00:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959868, 562418, 41409, '<td valign="top">A true symbol of triumph.  Maybe try and have more detail in the statue itself though.</td>', 'A true symbol of triumph.  Maybe try and have more detail in the statue itself though.', '2007-08-02 00:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959870, 562713, 41409, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, however I don''t see the triumph in this.  Is there a hidden message I''m missing?</td>', 'Beautiful picture, however I don''t see the triumph in this.  Is there a hidden message I''m missing?', '2007-08-02 00:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959875, 564447, 41409, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Impressive shot.  Wonderful editing.  I love it.</td>', 'Wow!  Impressive shot.  Wonderful editing.  I love it.', '2007-08-02 00:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959884, 562706, 41409, '<td valign="top">Amazing.  The only thing I''d like to see would be the swimmer being a bigger part of the frame.  Hardly something to be picky about though.</td>', 'Amazing.  The only thing I''d like to see would be the swimmer being a bigger part of the frame.  Hardly something to be picky about though.', '2007-08-02 00:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960039, 564447, 60174, '<td valign="top">The picture alone, without the title, doesn''t really read as triumph, but I love the photo.  So while I usually give lower scores to photos that rely on their title to meet the challenge, I''m giving this one of my top scores for this challenge.  Nice work.  The texture, the diagonal composition, the pop of yellow... all wonderful.</td>', 'The picture alone, without the title, doesn''t really read as triumph, but I love the photo.  So while I usually give lower scores to photos that rely on their title to meet the challenge, I''m giving this one of my top scores for this challenge.  Nice work.  The texture, the diagonal composition, the pop of yellow... all wonderful.', '2007-08-02 01:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960047, 562519, 60174, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing capture.  Perfect focus, nice composition, great color.  Though I bet it won''t score as well as it might have in another challenge simply because it relies on the title to convey the "triumph".</td>', 'This is an amazing capture.  Perfect focus, nice composition, great color.  Though I bet it won''t score as well as it might have in another challenge simply because it relies on the title to convey the "triumph".', '2007-08-02 01:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960119, 563957, 60047, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm. Quite a disturbing take on "Triumph," considering the wedding ring on her hand! Interesting that you chose to do this in B&amp;W. I think this one is a clever answer to the challenge.<br/> <br/>Follow-up comment - I guess I''m an idiot - it''s not a wedding ring! Still quite a clever answer to this challenge - nice job.</td>', 'Hmmmm. Quite a disturbing take on "Triumph," considering the wedding ring on her hand! Interesting that you chose to do this in B&W. I think this one is a clever answer to the challenge. Follow-up comment - I guess I''m an idiot - it''s not a wedding ring! Still quite a clever answer to this challenge - nice job.', '2007-08-02 01:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960363, 562519, 49969, '<td valign="top">congratulations!</td>', 'congratulations!', '2007-08-02 02:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960491, 563895, 57260, '<td valign="top">OMG This made me laugh! I think that''s what I look like in my dreams. Good humour.</td>', 'OMG This made me laugh! I think that''s what I look like in my dreams. Good humour.', '2007-08-02 04:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960495, 563486, 57260, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition. Expresses the theme very well. I like the leading lines created by the fence and the fact that it creates a nice seperation between the main subject and the cheering crowd and the DOF is spot on. Very well done. 10</td>', 'Very cool composition. Expresses the theme very well. I like the leading lines created by the fence and the fact that it creates a nice seperation between the main subject and the cheering crowd and the DOF is spot on. Very well done. 10', '2007-08-02 04:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960506, 564585, 57260, '<td valign="top">Not bad. Not WOW either. The net in the foreground doesn''t really serve any purpose in my opinion as it doesn''t add or strengten the composition, but rather distracts. I find there''s too much unnecessary elements in the picture (the trees, the fence, the white sky, the net) that doesn''t really help focus one''s attention on the theme of triumph. I would try filling most of the frame with the subject so his expression and sense of triumph is large and in your face. The whole thing looks a little too staged. Hope that helps and good luck for future challenges.</td>', 'Not bad. Not WOW either. The net in the foreground doesn''t really serve any purpose in my opinion as it doesn''t add or strengten the composition, but rather distracts. I find there''s too much unnecessary elements in the picture (the trees, the fence, the white sky, the net) that doesn''t really help focus one''s attention on the theme of triumph. I would try filling most of the frame with the subject so his expression and sense of triumph is large and in your face. The whole thing looks a little too staged. Hope that helps and good luck for future challenges.', '2007-08-02 04:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960514, 564440, 57260, '<td valign="top">Technically fine. Good composition, sharp detail, tonal range and all of it. I understand the idea behind the shot and personally it doesn''t really express the fullness of theme of triumph to me which I interpret as being emotionally charged. I experience the picture as unemotional. Good shot none the less. 7 and good luck.</td>', 'Technically fine. Good composition, sharp detail, tonal range and all of it. I understand the idea behind the shot and personally it doesn''t really express the fullness of theme of triumph to me which I interpret as being emotionally charged. I experience the picture as unemotional. Good shot none the less. 7 and good luck.', '2007-08-02 04:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960521, 562253, 57260, '<td valign="top">To me this expresses a sense of determination. Pretty good in keeping with the theme of triumph. Technically I think the image quality could be better. The focus seems just a tad soft and the sharpening a little over done judging by the black lines around the white areas (the pole in the forground and around the helmet). Nice composition overall.</td>', 'To me this expresses a sense of determination. Pretty good in keeping with the theme of triumph. Technically I think the image quality could be better. The focus seems just a tad soft and the sharpening a little over done judging by the black lines around the white areas (the pole in the forground and around the helmet). Nice composition overall.', '2007-08-02 04:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960532, 564101, 57260, '<td valign="top">Ho funny is that. I like the concentration on his face. He looks like an experienced knight in the jousting event. Fits the challenge well and I like it. Focus seems a tad soft.</td>', 'Ho funny is that. I like the concentration on his face. He looks like an experienced knight in the jousting event. Fits the challenge well and I like it. Focus seems a tad soft.', '2007-08-02 04:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960551, 563353, 57260, '<td valign="top">Whooaaa! I get chills just watching that. Nice action shot. Expresses the theme well. I would''ve cropped a little tighter to get rid of the white sky and perhaps B&amp;W would serve this shot seeing as the neon''s are a bit distracting. My rule of thumb is usually that if the colour doesn''t add to the theme of the picture, I make it B&amp;W since it''s less distracting and helps focus attention on the theme - personal preferance. Good luck.</td>', 'Whooaaa! I get chills just watching that. Nice action shot. Expresses the theme well. I would''ve cropped a little tighter to get rid of the white sky and perhaps B&W would serve this shot seeing as the neon''s are a bit distracting. My rule of thumb is usually that if the colour doesn''t add to the theme of the picture, I make it B&W since it''s less distracting and helps focus attention on the theme - personal preferance. Good luck.', '2007-08-02 04:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960559, 563957, 57260, '<td valign="top">It''s only a triumph if she actually answers (or remembers you) when you do call. ;) Good one</td>', 'It''s only a triumph if she actually answers (or remembers you) when you do call. ;) Good one', '2007-08-02 04:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960569, 564543, 57260, '<td valign="top">Yes, except if you''re a teenage boy or an executive with Durex, then the triumph will be one line ;) Nice composition.</td>', 'Yes, except if you''re a teenage boy or an executive with Durex, then the triumph will be one line ;) Nice composition.', '2007-08-02 04:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960805, 561453, 5333, '<td valign="top">if only you were shooting from the other side, this would score higher :)</td>', 'if only you were shooting from the other side, this would score higher :)', '2007-08-02 08:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3960809, 563640, 5333, '<td valign="top">best image representing triumph for me :) GL</td>', 'best image representing triumph for me :) GL', '2007-08-02 08:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961037, 562519, 60047, '<td valign="top">Easily one of the best hummingbird shots on DPC. The level of detail in the feathers is captivating. I can''t wait to see the specs on the glass as well as an explanation of how you were able to get this shot. Very well done.</td>', 'Easily one of the best hummingbird shots on DPC. The level of detail in the feathers is captivating. I can''t wait to see the specs on the glass as well as an explanation of how you were able to get this shot. Very well done.', '2007-08-02 09:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961039, 561453, 60047, '<td valign="top">Happiness, definitely - but Triumph?</td>', 'Happiness, definitely - but Triumph?', '2007-08-02 09:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961041, 563313, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice job on getting the rider in crisp focus. It''s great that he''s looking toward the camera. It''s a shame the two spectators on the right are not looking toward the rider and/or the flag.</td>', 'Nice job on getting the rider in crisp focus. It''s great that he''s looking toward the camera. It''s a shame the two spectators on the right are not looking toward the rider and/or the flag.', '2007-08-02 09:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961047, 564491, 60047, '<td valign="top">Really? That''s funny! With so much of the frame filled by the goat''s head, it would have been better to have had a crisper focus on the fur.</td>', 'Really? That''s funny! With so much of the frame filled by the goat''s head, it would have been better to have had a crisper focus on the fur.', '2007-08-02 09:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961058, 564447, 60047, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot. The diagonal is pleasing. The light level is spot on. I think the Triumph theme would have worked better here if you removed the other flower in the background and then adjusted the aperture for a greater DOF. Just a thought. BTW, I really like your choice of border for this shot.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot. The diagonal is pleasing. The light level is spot on. I think the Triumph theme would have worked better here if you removed the other flower in the background and then adjusted the aperture for a greater DOF. Just a thought. BTW, I really like your choice of border for this shot.', '2007-08-02 09:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961061, 563486, 60047, '<td valign="top">This shot drips of "Triumph." Nice job.</td>', 'This shot drips of "Triumph." Nice job.', '2007-08-02 09:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961073, 564101, 60047, '<td valign="top">How fun! This shot does a great job of telling a story of Triumph. Even more impressive is that I''ve never seen any game like this, before, so I was not predisposed to understand what was going on. The DOF &amp; crop work well to tell the story. The subject and the B&amp;W give this shot an older, nostalgic feel. The grinning woman in the background really helps this shot as well. Nicely done.</td>', 'How fun! This shot does a great job of telling a story of Triumph. Even more impressive is that I''ve never seen any game like this, before, so I was not predisposed to understand what was going on. The DOF & crop work well to tell the story. The subject and the B&W give this shot an older, nostalgic feel. The grinning woman in the background really helps this shot as well. Nicely done.', '2007-08-02 09:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961079, 564480, 60047, '<td valign="top">A great shot of a unique cultural event. I don''t get Triumph out of the shot, alone. Good crisp focus. In this light you can''t really adjust to pipe down the boy''s white shirt without losing detail in his kilt.</td>', 'A great shot of a unique cultural event. I don''t get Triumph out of the shot, alone. Good crisp focus. In this light you can''t really adjust to pipe down the boy''s white shirt without losing detail in his kilt.', '2007-08-02 10:00:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3961082, 563499, 60047, '<td valign="top">The shot is a bit dark. I wish the focus were more crisp. Good concept for the "Triumph" theme.</td>', 'The shot is a bit dark. I wish the focus were more crisp. Good concept for the "Triumph" theme.', '2007-08-02 10:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961088, 563255, 60047, '<td valign="top">This is a really fascinating B&amp;W shot of lines, textures and the silhouette. I don''t really get "Triumph" out of the picture, though.</td>', 'This is a really fascinating B&W shot of lines, textures and the silhouette. I don''t really get "Triumph" out of the picture, though.', '2007-08-02 10:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961090, 564354, 60047, '<td valign="top">This makes more sense as an entry to the "Triumph" challenge after reading the title.</td>', 'This makes more sense as an entry to the "Triumph" challenge after reading the title.', '2007-08-02 10:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961092, 562361, 60047, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cool shot. But wouldn''t this be taken toward the beginning of the race? I don''t get "Triumph" out of this.</td>', 'This is a pretty cool shot. But wouldn''t this be taken toward the beginning of the race? I don''t get "Triumph" out of this.', '2007-08-02 10:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961093, 563640, 38509, '<td valign="top">pure 10. good luck ! :-)</td>', 'pure 10. good luck ! :-)', '2007-08-02 10:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961100, 563640, 60047, '<td valign="top">This is a classic. Definitely fits the "Triumph" theme beautifully. You even have the agony of defeat in the lower left corner! What a great capture. Interesting that you chose B&amp;W. I wonder why?</td>', 'This is a classic. Definitely fits the "Triumph" theme beautifully. You even have the agony of defeat in the lower left corner! What a great capture. Interesting that you chose B&W. I wonder why?', '2007-08-02 10:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961113, 564543, 60047, '<td valign="top">A very clever shot for the challenge.Technically spot on as well. Nice job.</td>', 'A very clever shot for the challenge.Technically spot on as well. Nice job.', '2007-08-02 10:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961121, 562769, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wow, that sun really smacks you in the eyes.</td>', 'Wow, that sun really smacks you in the eyes.', '2007-08-02 10:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961126, 563315, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shot with a great use of the out-of-focus plane in the background.</td>', 'Nice crisp shot with a great use of the out-of-focus plane in the background.', '2007-08-02 10:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961131, 564618, 60047, '<td valign="top">I must be missing something, here. This shot does not say "Triumph" to me.</td>', 'I must be missing something, here. This shot does not say "Triumph" to me.', '2007-08-02 10:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961141, 564143, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition. It looks as if the medals are just a bit out of focus (the goggles in the top of the frame are good and crisp). A good answer to the challenge.</td>', 'Nice colors and composition. It looks as if the medals are just a bit out of focus (the goggles in the top of the frame are good and crisp). A good answer to the challenge.', '2007-08-02 10:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961146, 564505, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns on the ice. Good composition. I would almost say that a slower shutter speed that would allow just a bit of blur would lend more of a sense of movement to this shot - but then maybe the whites get blown out?</td>', 'Nice patterns on the ice. Good composition. I would almost say that a slower shutter speed that would allow just a bit of blur would lend more of a sense of movement to this shot - but then maybe the whites get blown out?', '2007-08-02 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961148, 563832, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice job of getting the shadow areas defined without the highlights getting blown out.</td>', 'Nice job of getting the shadow areas defined without the highlights getting blown out.', '2007-08-02 10:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961155, 564440, 60047, '<td valign="top">Definitely fits the challenge. The top of the standing chess piece is starting to blur.</td>', 'Definitely fits the challenge. The top of the standing chess piece is starting to blur.', '2007-08-02 10:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961161, 564418, 60047, '<td valign="top">A great "Triumph" vs defeat moment. Lighting (shadows) and composition have this fitting more into the "snapshot" realm, though.</td>', 'A great "Triumph" vs defeat moment. Lighting (shadows) and composition have this fitting more into the "snapshot" realm, though.', '2007-08-02 10:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961162, 564579, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great crisp shot for a night shot. Nice job.</td>', 'Great crisp shot for a night shot. Nice job.', '2007-08-02 10:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961170, 564265, 60047, '<td valign="top">He definitely tells the story, doesn''t he? The pp seems on the verge of being slightly over saturated.</td>', 'He definitely tells the story, doesn''t he? The pp seems on the verge of being slightly over saturated.', '2007-08-02 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961173, 564063, 60047, '<td valign="top">Definitely a triumphant pose. That sun sure is bright!</td>', 'Definitely a triumphant pose. That sun sure is bright!', '2007-08-02 10:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961381, 563950, 69368, '<td valign="top">Jason, it is yours?<br/> <br/>very nice idea for this challenge! good luck!</td>', 'Jason, it is yours? very nice idea for this challenge! good luck!', '2007-08-02 12:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961400, 563117, 69368, '<td valign="top">this made me smile :-)<br/>yes, it''s a real triumph!</td>', 'this made me smile :-)yes, it''s a real triumph!', '2007-08-02 12:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961526, 564246, 60047, '<td valign="top">It looks like your focus is closer to the back part of the frame. The subject is a little soft.</td>', 'It looks like your focus is closer to the back part of the frame. The subject is a little soft.', '2007-08-02 12:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961537, 563928, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great moment of triumph captured. Not only does the subject''s expression tell the story, the expressions on the faces in the crowd support the theme. Some of the highlights are a little blown.</td>', 'Great moment of triumph captured. Not only does the subject''s expression tell the story, the expressions on the faces in the crowd support the theme. Some of the highlights are a little blown.', '2007-08-02 12:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961545, 564582, 60047, '<td valign="top">I love the expression on her face (the tongue is a classic). I think the motion works - a faster shutter would have stopped the motion and taken away from the theme. Getting "Triumph" from this is just a bit of a stretch for me.</td>', 'I love the expression on her face (the tongue is a classic). I think the motion works - a faster shutter would have stopped the motion and taken away from the theme. Getting "Triumph" from this is just a bit of a stretch for me.', '2007-08-02 12:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961550, 563129, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great color. Focus just a bit off. Great happy expression (the toothlessness is a classic). Getting "Triumph" from this, however, is a bit of a stretch for me.</td>', 'Great color. Focus just a bit off. Great happy expression (the toothlessness is a classic). Getting "Triumph" from this, however, is a bit of a stretch for me.', '2007-08-02 12:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
