(3963911, 561493, 30861, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is fascinating. You were actually there? I hope voters see this as "successful pilgrimage", because to a Muslim this is one of life''s major triumphs, right? I didn''t even know you were allowed to photograph there; is that also a "triumph" for the photographer?<br/> <br/>Anyway, compelling image.</td>', 'Now THAT is fascinating. You were actually there? I hope voters see this as "successful pilgrimage", because to a Muslim this is one of life''s major triumphs, right? I didn''t even know you were allowed to photograph there; is that also a "triumph" for the photographer? Anyway, compelling image.', '2007-08-03 01:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
