(3965112, 564369, 80278, '<td valign="top">Wonderful to see some animal drama here for a change.<br/>A little more light on the face prey would help the image, using one of the many dodge and burn techniques. Would have given it a 10. 8</td>', 'Wonderful to see some animal drama here for a change.A little more light on the face prey would help the image, using one of the many dodge and burn techniques. Would have given it a 10. 8', '2007-08-03 09:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
