(3965121, 563499, 80278, '<td valign="top">Shot from lower down would have help to remove the distractions. Cloning or a tighter crop would remove the antenna. Still, a nice capture of a moment.</td>', 'Shot from lower down would have help to remove the distractions. Cloning or a tighter crop would remove the antenna. Still, a nice capture of a moment.', '2007-08-03 09:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3965128, 563893, 80278, '<td valign="top">Wish I could do that! Not that I ever could...  Wonderful tension and drama and wonderfully composed, with the half-cropped light and the smoke-haze to give DOF. Should win a biggie. 10</td>', 'Wish I could do that! Not that I ever could...  Wonderful tension and drama and wonderfully composed, with the half-cropped light and the smoke-haze to give DOF. Should win a biggie. 10', '2007-08-03 09:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3965135, 562769, 80278, '<td valign="top">Can sunrises be triumphant? Over what?</td>', 'Can sunrises be triumphant? Over what?', '2007-08-03 09:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3965147, 564520, 80278, '<td valign="top">Aw gee. Highlights on the diamonds would help immensely. Aren''t they supposed to sparkle? Not a lot of thought in terms of preparing the composition or lighting here. Also, a ring on the finger would add a personal touch.</td>', 'Aw gee. Highlights on the diamonds would help immensely. Aren''t they supposed to sparkle? Not a lot of thought in terms of preparing the composition or lighting here. Also, a ring on the finger would add a personal touch.', '2007-08-03 09:57:25.000000', NULL, 1);
