(3971645, 563555, 82296, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and angles.  I''m not sure what it is, but I love looking at it!</td>', 'Great perspective and angles.  I''m not sure what it is, but I love looking at it!', '2007-08-05 21:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
