(3971650, 564265, 18197, '<td valign="top">Too much post processing for my taste. If I knew the boy, I might share his triumph, but since I don''t, it feels like a snap to me. Sorry.</td>', 'Too much post processing for my taste. If I knew the boy, I might share his triumph, but since I don''t, it feels like a snap to me. Sorry.', '2007-08-05 21:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
