(3971664, 564418, 18197, '<td valign="top">Feels over exposed. Flash is too bright and is giving harsh shadows. Some of this you can fix in post processing (over exposure) but try bouncing the flash off the ceiling next time.</td>', 'Feels over exposed. Flash is too bright and is giving harsh shadows. Some of this you can fix in post processing (over exposure) but try bouncing the flash off the ceiling next time.', '2007-08-05 22:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3971672, 564543, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very very nice photo ... colors, focus, composition, essentially everything.  Best I''ve seen in the challenge so far. I can share your feeling of triumph. Good luck as parents!!!</td>', 'Very very nice photo ... colors, focus, composition, essentially everything.  Best I''ve seen in the challenge so far. I can share your feeling of triumph. Good luck as parents!!!', '2007-08-05 22:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
