(3971684, 562309, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! Great capture. Great image! I would love it if the plane were about 8-10 feet further through the pylons.</td>', 'Fantastic! Great capture. Great image! I would love it if the plane were about 8-10 feet further through the pylons.', '2007-08-05 22:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
