(3975856, 564418, 81362, '<td valign="top">The expressions capture it all, fitting the challenge so well that I went up a level in scoring despite the technical limitations. Besides, you have to grab the picture in the moment, so you probably didn''t have had time to set up more elaborate lighting or even diffuse the flash.</td>', 'The expressions capture it all, fitting the challenge so well that I went up a level in scoring despite the technical limitations. Besides, you have to grab the picture in the moment, so you probably didn''t have had time to set up more elaborate lighting or even diffuse the flash.', '2007-08-07 00:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975862, 563362, 63244, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful photograph. Your bokeh is very good and your detail is sharp. The colors really make this inviting. I like the back lighting on your subject as well. It highlights the babe and those little golden curls.  Because the light is only really "shining" on your model, she really stands out. Beautiful!</td>', 'What a beautiful photograph. Your bokeh is very good and your detail is sharp. The colors really make this inviting. I like the back lighting on your subject as well. It highlights the babe and those little golden curls.  Because the light is only really "shining" on your model, she really stands out. Beautiful!', '2007-08-07 00:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975865, 564453, 63244, '<td valign="top">Nice photojournalistic photo. Your focus is spot on. Great capture in that the smoke really adds interest as well as a touch of mystery to this. Color is great. Hope all were ok!</td>', 'Nice photojournalistic photo. Your focus is spot on. Great capture in that the smoke really adds interest as well as a touch of mystery to this. Color is great. Hope all were ok!', '2007-08-07 00:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975868, 561647, 63244, '<td valign="top">Great job on textures. Perhaps a touch more contrast so the doggy stood out a tiny bit more? :) HI like the blue and green trophy ribbons on the fence. It goes with the attitude of the dog. Nice composition here.</td>', 'Great job on textures. Perhaps a touch more contrast so the doggy stood out a tiny bit more? :) HI like the blue and green trophy ribbons on the fence. It goes with the attitude of the dog. Nice composition here.', '2007-08-07 00:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
