(3975939, 563950, 63244, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful silhouette. I love the clouds low in the background as they help add texture in dimension to your shot. The pose of your model is excellent - V for victory! Gorgeous colors.</td>', 'What a beautiful silhouette. I love the clouds low in the background as they help add texture in dimension to your shot. The pose of your model is excellent - V for victory! Gorgeous colors.', '2007-08-07 01:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
