(3976002, 562653, 63244, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  In our college television classes this was called a "nostril shot". This angle gives the appearance of dominance and power, but not the most flattering for people (and especially us girls!) ;PNice idea.</td>', 'Nice shot.  In our college television classes this was called a "nostril shot". This angle gives the appearance of dominance and power, but not the most flattering for people (and especially us girls!) ;PNice idea.', '2007-08-07 01:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
