(3980979, 562519, 74371, '<td valign="top">Although, as many have stated, this doesn''t fit the challenge in the literal sense... to those who have ever tried taking shots of these amazing birds, triumph is the only word to describe your picture. This is an outstanding and, due to the elusiveness of the humdingers, very unique photograph!! Congrats on the blue, but mostly on being so patient in order to attain this thing of beauty!<br/> <br/>I, amongst many others, am extremely envious and jealous!!!!</td>', 'Although, as many have stated, this doesn''t fit the challenge in the literal sense... to those who have ever tried taking shots of these amazing birds, triumph is the only word to describe your picture. This is an outstanding and, due to the elusiveness of the humdingers, very unique photograph!! Congrats on the blue, but mostly on being so patient in order to attain this thing of beauty! I, amongst many others, am extremely envious and jealous!!!!', '2007-08-08 13:09:49.000000', NULL, 0),
