(3981007, 562519, 35720, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture! Congrats on the blue ribbon!</td>', 'Fantastic capture! Congrats on the blue ribbon!', '2007-08-08 13:15:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3981015, 562519, 55985, '<td valign="top">Great job!  Can you post any outtakes or post-processing details on this one?</td>', 'Great job!  Can you post any outtakes or post-processing details on this one?', '2007-08-08 13:18:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3981018, 563950, 42254, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the win for an outstanding shot &amp; inspiring story; good to see the ''real'' Andrew in the other shots being so active! Love the fishing one.</td>', 'Congrats on the win for an outstanding shot & inspiring story; good to see the ''real'' Andrew in the other shots being so active! Love the fishing one.', '2007-08-08 13:19:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3981177, 562519, 77192, '<td valign="top">Stretching the challenge a bit aren''t you? ;-) No only joking, this a great shot and fully deserves the ribbon. Well done!!</td>', 'Stretching the challenge a bit aren''t you? ;-) No only joking, this a great shot and fully deserves the ribbon. Well done!!', '2007-08-08 14:09:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3981178, 563950, 56797, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. congrats!</td>', 'Beautiful image. congrats!', '2007-08-08 14:10:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3981268, 562519, 58728, '<td valign="top">AMazing!  Congrats on the blue, and congrats for capturing this little beauty with your macro.  :)</td>', 'AMazing!  Congrats on the blue, and congrats for capturing this little beauty with your macro.  :)', '2007-08-08 14:40:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3981299, 563640, 7889, '<td valign="top">Gongratulations Gordon on a well deserved ribbon.<br/> <br/>Mike<br/> <br/></td>', 'Gongratulations Gordon on a well deserved ribbon. Mike ', '2007-08-08 14:53:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3981311, 563950, 68256, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the great comments, they are greatly appreciated!</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the great comments, they are greatly appreciated!', '2007-08-08 14:56:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3981726, 562519, 52115, '<td valign="top">That''s not even "thinking outside the box",<br/>"Shoe-horning", a super photo, Yes.<br/> <br/>Some might say, "Gee, could have photographed a speeding train", all of our First-Steps taken on 2-Legs, are Personal Triumphs (boring). But comparatively, everyone knows hummingbirds are "Faster-and-More-Elusive".<br/> <br/>IF I got a more partial Frontal-Closeup shot of a fast moving Cheetah or a Charging white Rhino, that may have come in 2nd-Place. A Cheetah catching it''s prey in middair, that''s a triumph for both.<br/>"Triumph" Spitfire... Not.<br/> <br/></td>', 'That''s not even "thinking outside the box","Shoe-horning", a super photo, Yes. Some might say, "Gee, could have photographed a speeding train", all of our First-Steps taken on 2-Legs, are Personal Triumphs (boring). But comparatively, everyone knows hummingbirds are "Faster-and-More-Elusive". IF I got a more partial Frontal-Closeup shot of a fast moving Cheetah or a Charging white Rhino, that may have come in 2nd-Place. A Cheetah catching it''s prey in middair, that''s a triumph for both."Triumph" Spitfire... Not. ', '2007-08-08 17:59:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3981748, 563640, 35720, '<td valign="top">You have captured a great moment, excellent! Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'You have captured a great moment, excellent! Congrats on your ribbon!', '2007-08-08 18:07:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3981752, 563950, 35720, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image! Congrat on your yellow ribbon!</td>', 'Gorgeous image! Congrat on your yellow ribbon!', '2007-08-08 18:08:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3981758, 562519, 32495, '<td valign="top">Amazing. I have been trying forever to get a picture like this. Aren''t they wonderful little jems? Congradulations on the wonderful picture.</td>', 'Amazing. I have been trying forever to get a picture like this. Aren''t they wonderful little jems? Congradulations on the wonderful picture.', '2007-08-08 18:10:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3981875, 563640, 30807, '<td valign="top">Gosh, Gordon - nice retouch. Well deserved result!<br/> <br/>I wondered how the Dutch Press liked the shots - hope nothing nasty happened - you must be a seasoned pro though, so they will understand it was a technical blip. <br/> <br/>I find with shooting Raw that I can get away with a fair bit of underexposure, and use DxO to help bring zap into flattish contrast situations - it does a better job than I can - do you have a favourite way to deal with over/under exposure?</td>', 'Gosh, Gordon - nice retouch. Well deserved result! I wondered how the Dutch Press liked the shots - hope nothing nasty happened - you must be a seasoned pro though, so they will understand it was a technical blip.  I find with shooting Raw that I can get away with a fair bit of underexposure, and use DxO to help bring zap into flattish contrast situations - it does a better job than I can - do you have a favourite way to deal with over/under exposure?', '2007-08-08 19:01:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3981983, 563640, 14603, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by adrian45:</b></div><hr/><i> I wondered how the Dutch Press liked the shots - hope nothing nasty happened - you must be a seasoned pro though, so they will understand it was a technical blip. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment Adrian..in answer to above,only a small amount of shots on the day were overexposed..so I had a large amount to choose from when selecting for the press.<br/>I mainly shoot for the team`s website www.falkirkfc.co.uk and the matchday magazine..only very occasionally am I asked to supply the press.The whole thing is a hobby and I`m far from being a Pro.<br/> <br/>I have shot in Raw previously and knew of it`s benefits with returning detail into blown highlights but never found much advantage to it in terms of keeping noise out of enlargements with underexposed shots but maybe that`s down to my lack of knowledge on the technical side of things..I am considering shooting in Raw once more and doing a bit of research into getting the best out my camera..hadn`t heard of DxO until you mentioned it and I`ll certainly look into that.<br/> <br/>Thanks again.<br/>Gordon</td>', 'Originally posted by adrian45: I wondered how the Dutch Press liked the shots - hope nothing nasty happened - you must be a seasoned pro though, so they will understand it was a technical blip.   Thanks for the comment Adrian..in answer to above,only a small amount of shots on the day were overexposed..so I had a large amount to choose from when selecting for the press.I mainly shoot for the team`s website www.falkirkfc.co.uk and the matchday magazine..only very occasionally am I asked to supply the press.The whole thing is a hobby and I`m far from being a Pro. I have shot in Raw previously and knew of it`s benefits with returning detail into blown highlights but never found much advantage to it in terms of keeping noise out of enlargements with underexposed shots but maybe that`s down to my lack of knowledge on the technical side of things..I am considering shooting in Raw once more and doing a bit of research into getting the best out my camera..hadn`t heard of DxO until you mentioned it and I`ll certainly look into that. Thanks again.Gordon', '2007-08-08 19:33:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3982030, 562519, 41981, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I know from personal experience how difficult and time consuming the effort took.  Congrats</td>', 'Nice shot.  I know from personal experience how difficult and time consuming the effort took.  Congrats', '2007-08-08 19:51:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3982185, 563950, 80588, '<td valign="top">Heart warming! Congratulations!</td>', 'Heart warming! Congratulations!', '2007-08-08 21:11:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3982462, 562519, 65048, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2007-08-08 22:48:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3982667, 564505, 50695, '<td valign="top">glorious. this easily deserves its top 20, and is better than the other 19. congratulations.</td>', 'glorious. this easily deserves its top 20, and is better than the other 19. congratulations.', '2007-08-08 23:55:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3982716, 562519, 61864, '<td valign="top">The colors are amazing, how did you capture this photo so vividly.It''s just gourgeous.</td>', 'The colors are amazing, how did you capture this photo so vividly.It''s just gourgeous.', '2007-08-09 00:19:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3983065, 563893, 63267, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what I am more in awe of, the skill these two men have to pull of such a stunt, or the skill you have to photograph it so well.  <br/> <br/>When I see the lights in the background, coupled with the smoke and what looks like a dark stage I am awestruck as to how you managed to get such a clean image with what had to have been very difficult lighting to obtain a good exposure.<br/> <br/>The shadows and highlights are so well controlled, the image is sharp and the colors are still very appearant.  <br/> <br/>This is just a fascinating photo when you consider the technicals in such a difficult location.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on the top 5 and another oh so close to 7 score. In the end you have a fantastic photo, a great score, and a memory that will make it all worth it!<br/> <br/>Well done!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-09 03:13:24.</i></td>', 'I don''t know what I am more in awe of, the skill these two men have to pull of such a stunt, or the skill you have to photograph it so well.   When I see the lights in the background, coupled with the smoke and what looks like a dark stage I am awestruck as to how you managed to get such a clean image with what had to have been very difficult lighting to obtain a good exposure. The shadows and highlights are so well controlled, the image is sharp and the colors are still very appearant.   This is just a fascinating photo when you consider the technicals in such a difficult location. Congratulations on the top 5 and another oh so close to 7 score. In the end you have a fantastic photo, a great score, and a memory that will make it all worth it! Well done!', '2007-08-09 04:12:02.000000', '2007-08-09 04:13:24.000000', 0),
(3983089, 563950, 81849, '<td valign="top">A really sad story and a great picture! Congrats.</td>', 'A really sad story and a great picture! Congrats.', '2007-08-09 04:34:26.000000', NULL, 0),
