(3986767, 564447, 40679, '<td valign="top">yeah, sometimes it''s just good to photograph something different than the thing you''re used to. it frees the mind, so to say..!<br/> <br/>this looks wonderful.. the colors are good and contrasting, great DoF!</td>', 'yeah, sometimes it''s just good to photograph something different than the thing you''re used to. it frees the mind, so to say..! this looks wonderful.. the colors are good and contrasting, great DoF!', '2007-08-10 12:55:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3986819, 562519, 66952, '<td valign="top">Serious bummer about the DQ. You entered this before the other one was DQ''d, didn''t you? It doesn''t diminish the quality of the shot, though. I keep coming back and looking at it. Awesome!</td>', 'Serious bummer about the DQ. You entered this before the other one was DQ''d, didn''t you? It doesn''t diminish the quality of the shot, though. I keep coming back and looking at it. Awesome!', '2007-08-10 13:07:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3986833, 562519, 31341, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by annpatt:</b></div><hr/><i> Serious bummer about the DQ. You entered this before the other one was DQ''d, didn''t you? It doesn''t diminish the quality of the shot, though. I keep coming back and looking at it. Awesome! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Exactly.  I knew this was coming, but have enjoyed the ride.<br/> <br/>jeff</td>', 'Originally posted by annpatt: Serious bummer about the DQ. You entered this before the other one was DQ''d, didn''t you? It doesn''t diminish the quality of the shot, though. I keep coming back and looking at it. Awesome!   Exactly.  I knew this was coming, but have enjoyed the ride. jeff', '2007-08-10 13:14:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3986839, 564543, 58728, '<td valign="top">OH WOWS!  Congrats to you both!  I''m so happy for you!  And a top 10 finish too!  ;)  Yay for baby!!!</td>', 'OH WOWS!  Congrats to you both!  I''m so happy for you!  And a top 10 finish too!  ;)  Yay for baby!!!', '2007-08-10 13:18:04.000000', NULL, 0),
